{"data":{"id":1817,"name":"VGX Token","symbol":"VGX","slug":"vgx-token","category":"token","description":"## What is VGX Token (VGX)?\nThe VGX token serves as a cross-platform and cross-chain token focused on the gaming space. The goal of the VGX Foundation is to partner with projects and companies to integrate VGX in games and platforms, offering rewards and ownership for players regardless of the chain the game is built on.\n\n## What Makes VGX Token Unique?\nVGX is a Play-to-Earn GameFi token led by the VGX Foundation.\n\nThe VGX Foundation makes strategic grants to Web3 gaming companies to incorporate the VGX token in play-to-earn models into their games. To date, the VGX token has been added to Voyager: Ascension, Genopets, and Honeyland, and the list of scheduled integrations is growing.\n\nThe VGX community can earn VGX by playing these games. The token serves as both an in-game currency and a reward mechanism for player achievements.\n\nThe VGX token is game- and platform-agnostic. Holders can earn VGX in one game and take those tokens to another game to pay for in-game items.\n\nThe VGX token is currently on the ERC-20 standard. The team is working on a bridging solution to make the token chain-agnostic.","dateAdded":"2017-07-18T00:00:00.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2017-07-18T17:45:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":0,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"The VGX ecosystem is now managed by VGX Foundation, separate from Voyager Digital. For more information, kindly visit [here](https://medium.com/@vgxfoundation/a-new-chapter-for-vgx-a7758e8cd8c8).","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:43:00.000Z","watchCount":"85529","watchListRanking":444,"latestAdded":false,"launchPrice":0.0686505,"tags":[{"slug":"asset-management","name":"Asset Management","category":"INDUSTRY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"wallet","name":"Wallet","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"ethereum-ecosystem","name":"Ethereum Ecosystem","category":"PLATFOR